; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM_Qry.c	   440   * \synchronous TRUE
; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM_Qry.c	   441   * \config Repair Redundant Blocks Api is enabled
; ..\BSW364\NvM\Implementation\NvM_Qry.c	   442   * \pre -
